cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PathoMap in your research, please cite this dataset."
title: "PathoMap: a curated host-pathogen effector and intracellular survival-strategy dataset"
abstract: >-
  A curated dataset of bacterial pathogens, their secreted effector proteins,
  the host proteins they target, and the intracellular survival strategy each
  pathogen employs, with reproducible analysis code (network analysis, a
  Random Forest survival-strategy classifier, effector sequence features, and
  literature-linked records).
